The first trend that has been making waves in the world of digital marketing is the use of artificial intelligence (AI). With AI, companies can gather data and analyze it more efficiently, allowing them to make more informed decisions about their marketing strategies. AI-powered chatbots are also becoming increasingly popular as they can engage with customers in real-time, providing personalized recommendations and assistance. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
That's interesting. How about the second trend? What could it be?
