<|end|>
<|user|>
I’ve heard about it, but what distinguishes the third trend from traditional marketing methods?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
The third trend is the shift towards video marketing. Video content is becoming increasingly popular among consumers, and studies have shown that it is more engaging than other forms of content such as text or images. Video marketing can take many forms, from short-form videos on social media to longer-form content on platforms like YouTube. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
That’s really insightful. What about the fourth trend? How does it differ from the other trends?
