<|asst|>
Artificial intelligence (AI) is a broad field of computer science focused on creating intelligent machines that can perform tasks that typically require human-like intelligence, such as visual perception, speech recognition, decision-making, and language translation. Machine learning (ML) is a subfield of AI that focuses on developing algorithms that can learn from data and make predictions or decisions without being explicitly programmed to do so. In other words, ML is a way to achieve AI by training algorithms on large datasets, allowing them to improve their performance over time. <|endoftext|>
