Are you up for a challenge? Can you use your Python skills to not only create a visually appealing web page but also integrate multimedia and scientific research papers in a unique way? Here's the twist - can you present the three research papers in a puzzle or game format that requires critical thinking to solve? 
To start off, can you provide some code snippets for structuring the HTML page? But remember, the real challenge lies in how you present the research papers. Can you make it interactive, engaging and thought-provoking? The goal is to not only inform but also make the audience think and apply the knowledge gained. Can you rise up to the challenge?
