Here is an example output of a simple linear regression model: 

```
Coefficients:
 Estimate Std. Error t-value Pr(>|t|) 
(Intercept) 5.84132 0.72289 8.076 4.83e-11 ***
x 1.03483 0.03654 28.308 < 2e-16 ***
