<|end|>
<|asst|>
Your customized R function for multi-variable linear regression analysis looks good. Here is an example usage of the function on the "mtcars" dataset:
```R
# Load the "mtcars" dataset
data(mtcars)
# Call your custom function with "mpg" as response variable and "wt", "cyl", "disp" as predictor variables
custom_lin_reg(mtcars, "mpg", c("wt", "cyl", "disp"))
```
This will output a detailed summary of the regression analysis, including p-values and coefficients for each predictor variable. The function also handles missing values and outliers in the dataset appropriately by using the `na.action=na.omit` argument in the `lm()` function. <|endoftext|>
