<|end|>
<|asst|>
Engage in regular physical exercise, practice mindfulness and meditation techniques, get plenty of restful sleep, eat a balanced and healthy diet, seek social support from friends and family, and consider therapy or counseling if necessary. It's also important to identify the sources of your stress and anxiety and work on addressing them directly. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
