Sure, here are the top ten highest-grossing sci-fi movies in the past decade along with their primary themes or concepts:
1. Avengers: Endgame (2019) - Time Travel and Superheroes
2. Star Wars: The Force Awakens (2015) - Space Opera and Jedi Knights
3. Avengers: Infinity War (2018) - Superheroes and Cosmic Threats
4. Jurassic World (2015) - Cloning and Dinosaurs
5. The Avengers (2012) - Superheroes and Teamwork
6. Inception (2010) - Dreams and Reality
7. Avatar (2009) - Environmentalism and Alien Culture
8. The Hunger Games: Catching Fire (2013) - Dystopia and Rebellion
9. Iron Man 3 (2013) - Superheroes and Technology
10. The Hunger Games (2012) - Dystopia and Survival <|endoftext|>
