<|user|>
Calculate the total cost of a luxury leather purse that costs $500 and has a state sales tax rate of 8.5% in California. The cost of the purse also includes an additional luxury tax of 10%.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
The state sales tax rate of 8.5% on a $500 luxury leather purse is $42.50. 
The cost of the purse with the state sales tax is $500 + $42.50 = $542.50. 
The additional luxury tax of 10% on $542.50 is $54.25. 
Therefore, the total cost of the luxury leather purse with both taxes is $542.50 + $54.25 = $596.75. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
