4. Offer suggestions for improving insights or identifying new factors driving churn based on the player's model.
5. Allow players to revisit earlier stages of the game to refine their models and insights based on new information or feedback.

By incorporating these feedback loops, players can learn from their mistakes and improve their models and insights, ultimately leading to better customer retention outcomes for businesses. <|endoftext|>
