The method first calculates the equivalent rating on a 1-star scale by dividing 1 by the maximum rating (`maxRating`). It then multiplies the input rating (`rating`) by this value to get the converted rating. Finally, it rounds the converted rating to two decimal places using the `Math.Round` method and returns the result.
