<|user|>
How do dogs show affection towards humans?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Dogs show affection towards humans through various ways such as wagging their tail, licking their faces or hands, leaning against them, bringing them their favorite toys, and following them around. They also have the ability to sense human emotions and offer comfort and support during times of stress or sadness. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
Can dogs recognize themselves in a mirror?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
While dogs do have the ability to recognize other animals and humans, research has shown that they do not have the capability to recognize themselves in a mirror. This is because they rely more on their sense of smell rather than vision and do not have the same level of self-awareness as humans. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
Do dogs dream?
