You'll also need to replace "Mumbai" with the name of the city you want to find the latitude and longitude for. Once you've done that, run the code and it will print the latitude and longitude of the city. You can use this information to find the best place to view a sunset using a tool like SunCalc (https://www.suncalc.org/). <|endoftext|>
