```
shasum -a 256 document.pdf
```
This command will output the SHA-256 hash of the file "document.pdf" in your terminal.
To rename all the files in a directory with a ".txt" extension to have a ".md" extension instead, you can use the following command in your terminal:
```
rename 's/.txt$/.md/' *.txt
```
This command will rename all the files in the current directory that have a ".txt" extension to have a ".md" extension instead. <|endoftext|>
