I want to analyze the HTML structure of a website to determine its type. Specifically, I want to know if the website is an e-commerce site, a blog, a news site, or something else. Let's take www.amazon.com as an example.
Can you provide me with the HTML structure of this website so that I can analyze it? Additionally, what specific HTML tags or elements should I look for to determine the type of the website?
<|end|>
