Why do people sometimes prefer to read fiction over non-fiction?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
There are several reasons why people may prefer to read fiction over non-fiction. First, fiction allows readers to escape from reality and immerse themselves in a different world, which can be both entertaining and therapeutic. Additionally, fiction often explores complex characters and relationships, providing insights into the human condition that can be difficult to find in non-fiction. Finally, fiction can be more engaging and enjoyable to read, as it often uses literary devices and techniques to create a more compelling narrative. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
