This color combination has a high contrast ratio between the primary and secondary colors, <|fim_suf|>, while the light gray secondary color provides a calming background. The bright yellow accent color can be used sparingly to draw attention to important elements on the website. Overall, this color combination is both visually appealing and accessible to a wide range of users. <|endoftext|>
