<|asst|>
The Washington Monument has been a witness to numerous significant events throughout American history. Some notable examples include Martin Luther King Jr.'s "I Have a Dream" speech during the March on Washington in 1963, the dedication of the Vietnam Veterans Memorial in 1982, and the "Rally for Sanity" hosted by Jon Stewart and Stephen Colbert in 2010. <|endoftext|>
