5. Friendly - Hostile
6. Generous - Stingy
7. Humble - Arrogant
8. Innocent - Guilty
9. Jovial - Gloomy
10. Kind - Cruel
The total number of letters in all the adjectives and antonyms combined is 120, which is a prime number. <|endoftext|>
