Calculate the sum of integers from 1 to n using a recursive function in Java. The function should have the following signature: 
public static int sum(int n)
where n is the upper limit of the sum. The function should return the sum of integers from 1 to n. Use the formula for the sum of an arithmetic sequence to implement the function.
