As Alice was busy grinding coffee beans and boiling water for her favorite brew, Bob was sipping on a cup of warm tea while seated at the kitchen table. Meanwhile, <|fim_suf|>, Alice was most likely using a coffee grinder and a kettle to make coffee. Bob was most likely using a kettle to make tea. Finally, Carol was most likely using a mixing bowl and a muffin tin to bake muffins in the oven. <|endoftext|>
