To include gamification elements like leaderboards and a point system, you can use JavaScript to create interactive and engaging features that encourage users to stay engaged with your app. You can also use social media integration to allow users to share their progress and achievements with their friends and followers.
To integrate wearable technology to track user's health data in real-time, you can use APIs provided by wearable device manufacturers. This will allow you to access and use the data collected by wearable devices to provide personalized recommendations to users based on their activity levels and health data.
