How can I improve my critical thinking skills?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
You can improve your critical thinking skills by practicing active listening and reading, questioning assumptions, analyzing and evaluating arguments, considering different perspectives, and seeking out reliable sources of information. Additionally, engaging in activities that challenge your mind, such as puzzles or debates, can also help to sharpen your critical thinking abilities. <|endoftext|>
