end{document}
```

In this code, the `graphicx` package is used to insert an image into the document. The `usepackage` command is used to include the package in the document. The `includegraphics` command is used to insert the image, and the `[width=textwidth]` option is used to set the width of the image to the full text width. <|endoftext|>
