Steamed Pork Dumplings Recipe
Steamed Pork Dumplings
======================
Ingredients
-----------
* 1 pound ground pork
* 2 cloves garlic, minced
* 1 tablespoon ginger, grated
* 2 tablespoons soy sauce
* 1 tablespoon sesame oil
* 1/4 cup green onions, chopped
* 1 package dumpling wrappers
* 1/4 cup water
Instructions
------------
1. In a large mixing bowl, combine ground pork, garlic, ginger, soy sauce, sesame oil, and green onions.
2. Mix well until all ingredients are evenly distributed.
3. Place a heaping tablespoon of the pork mixture onto a dumpling wrapper.
4. Use your finger to moisten the edges of the wrapper with water.
5. Fold the wrapper in half and press the edges together to seal.
6. Repeat steps 3-5 with remaining wrappers and filling.
7. Place the dumplings into a steamer basket and steam for 10-12 minutes.
8. Serve hot with soy sauce or your favorite dipping sauce.
Nutrition Information
---------------------


