Write 3 laws of motion.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
1) An object at rest will remain at rest unless acted upon by an external force.
2) The acceleration of an object is directly proportional to the net force acting on the object, and inversely proportional to its mass.
3) For every action, there is an equal and opposite reaction. <|endoftext|>
