Certainly! Here is the HTML code for the table you described:
```

 table {
 border-collapse: collapse;
 width: 100%;
 max-width: 800px;
 margin: auto;
 font-size: 16px;
 line-height: 1.5;
 text-align: center;
 }
 th {
 background-color: #4CAF50;
 color: white;
 font-weight: bold;
 padding: 8px;
 text-align: center;
 vertical-align: middle;
 border: 1px solid #ddd;
 }
 td {
 padding: 8px;
 text-align: center;
 vertical-align: middle;
 border: 1px solid #ddd;
 }
 td:first-child {
 text-align: left;
 }
 td:last-child {
 text-align: right;
 }
 


| Column 1 | Column 2 | Column 3 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Left-aligned text | Centered text | Right-aligned text |
| 1234567890 | 1234567890 | 1234567890 |
| ABCDEFGHIJ | ABCDEFGHIJ | ABCDEFGHIJ |


```
