<|fim_suf|>, a thick, juicy T-bone steak seasoned simply with salt, pepper, and olive oil. Ribollita, a hearty soup made from bread, vegetables, and beans, is another staple dish in Florence. Lastly, Cantucci, a type of biscotti typically served with Vin Santo dessert wine, is a must-try sweet treat. <|endoftext|>
