<|user|>
Are there any festivals or events that take place in Florence throughout the year?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
There are several festivals and events that take place in Florence throughout the year. One of the most famous ones is the Carnevale di Firenze or the Carnival of Florence, a colorful and lively celebration that takes place in February. The Maggio Musicale Fiorentino, or the Florentine Musical May, is a renowned music festival featuring classical and contemporary performances that occurs from April to June. Others include the Festa della Rificolona, an annual lantern parade celebrated each September, and the Christmas markets held in December. <|endoftext|>
