What is the difference between artificial intelligence and machine learning?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Artificial Intelligence (AI) is a broader term that encompasses all the ways in which computers can be made to behave intelligently. Machine Learning (ML) is one of the techniques used to enable AI, where machines learn from experience and improve their performance on a given task over time without being explicitly programmed. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
Can you give an example of supervised learning in machine learning?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
