Can you tell me about the features of the new Apple Watch?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Sure, the new Apple Watch has a variety of features. It can track your workouts and physical activity, monitor your heart rate, and provide you with notifications for messages, calls, and other apps. It also has a built-in GPS and cellular connectivity, allowing you to make calls and send texts without your phone. Additionally, it has a water resistance rating of 50 meters, making it suitable for swimming and other water activities. <|endoftext|>
